# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# This is not cosmetic. A batch edit written by a Windows-side script rewrote
# six source files as CRLF while the other twenty-eight stayed LF, and a
# checker that split those files on "\n" then silently matched zero entries and
# reported "no drafts" while a draft entry was present. Pinning the repository
# to LF removes that whole class of failure.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
